"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">President Donald J. Trump has concluded his four-day visit to the Philippines and China where he advanced his America First agenda, secured billions in deals that support American workers, ensured a free and open Indo-Pacific that benefits everyday Americans, and bolstered regional security to protect Americans from illicit activity abroad. <strong>At home or abroad, President Trump is delivering for Americans.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This week, in the Indo-Pacific, President Trump secured real and tangible wins for the American people on trade, energy, economic growth, and cracking down on crime.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/11/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-secures-historic-economic-deals-for-american-workers-and-strengthens-americas-leadership-in-asia/\"><strong>Secured</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;over $17 billion in deals benefiting tens of thousands of American workers and American companies.</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>These deals support the jobs of American farmers, manufacturers, and technicians, and help rebuild our defense industrial base. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2122670007964356775?a=MeIPy-y-8beiW-77L5o&amp;s=20\">Signed</a> a<strong> trade deal with Thailand</strong> – <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefings-statements/2026/11/joint-statement-on-an-agreement-between-the-united-states-of-america-and-the-kingdom-of-thailand-on-reciprocal-trade/\">eliminating</a> Thailand’s tariffs on 99% of all U.S. exports and unlocking market access for a variety of U.S. industrial and agricultural exports such as vehicles, medical devices, pharmaceuticals, ethanol, and poultry. <ul><li>Thailand will also buy an additional $2.6 billion in U.S. agricultural products each year, supporting our great farmers and ranchers. President Trump also <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/11/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-secures-historic-economic-deals-for-american-workers-and-strengthens-americas-leadership-in-asia/#:~:text=The%20leaders%20also%20committed%20to%20eliminate%20the%20U.S.%20trade%20deficit%20with%20the%20Philippines%20through%20increased%20Philippine%20imports%20of%20American%20energy%20and%20agriculture%20products%2C\">announced</a> the Philippines’ commitment to eliminate the U.S. trade deficit with the Philippines.</li></ul>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Thanks to President Trump’s America First trade policies,&nbsp;<strong>American exports are at an&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://tradingeconomics.com/united-states/exports\"><strong>all-time high</strong></a><strong>.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2122680681276776607?a=NXJhtNl79CZkN_T7_Xw&amp;s=20\">Announced</a>&nbsp;the approval of a massive LNG pipeline in Alaska that South Korea and Taiwan helped fund, which will produce record amounts of abundant and affordable American Energy,&nbsp;<strong>lowering Americans’ energy costs and bolstering our energy security and dominance</strong>.\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Because of the Trump Administration’s energy dominance agenda,&nbsp;U.S. energy production is at a record high.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefings-statements/2026/11/u-s-russia-china-heads-of-state-declaration-toward-peace/\">Met</a> with the President of Russia and the President of China in a first-ever trilateral meeting of the Presidents. <strong>President Trump will meet with anyone who is willing to work together to make the lives of Americans – and the world – more prosperous and secure.</strong><ul><li>President Trump <a href=\"https://x.com/WhiteHouse/status/2123401811327619388?a=hIGEW2BM7fqayFRCQms&amp;s=20\">emphasized</a> the special responsibility the three global leaders have to maintaining open, respectful, and productive dialogue.President Trump called for the <a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2123338944624685475?a=3yq2z0D9R-VGJqhG5t4&amp;s=20\">reduction</a> of the number of nuclear weapons in the world and the <a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2123339626610119150?a=w0XrUjl2tTwp33DoMjQ&amp;s=20\">end</a> of the war between Russia and Ukraine. </li></ul>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Additionally, the leaders&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefings-statements/2026/11/u-s-russia-china-heads-of-state-declaration-toward-peace/\">committed</a>&nbsp;to advancing peace across the world.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Thanks to President Trump’s leadership in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/08/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-expands-capabilities-to-combat-transnational-cyber-enabled-crime/\">cracking down</a>&nbsp;on transnational criminal organizations that target and attack Americans, ASEAN&nbsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2122675997367799957?a=LtAOt-kZn58_7H-1P8o&amp;s=20\">adopted</a>&nbsp;a comprehensive work plan to tackle online scams.\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>President Trump is committed to addressing crime targeting Americans regardless of where it originates.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Held a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefings-statements/2026/11/quad-leaders-summit-joint-press-release/\">meeting</a>&nbsp;with Quad Leaders to tackle the region’s toughest challenges and ensure a free and open Indo-Pacific.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>At this year’s APEC Summit, President Trump&nbsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2123250057747046857?a=rYu6FjZOg97wA65qIsA&amp;s=20\">championed</a>&nbsp;America’s economic growth and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2123249678032466075?a=jAYj9any8BSoyeLlqj4&amp;s=20\">highlighted</a>&nbsp;the extraordinary prosperity that Super Intelligence is unleashing to all people all around the world.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/president-trump-brings-home-billions-in-economic-growth-and-strengthens-americas-security/\">President Trump Brings Home Billions in Economic Growth and Strengthens America’s Security</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
